<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound o/n and weekly rates fall.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound o/n and weekly rates fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Egyptian pound fell in a private sector market that began short but later eased to between 8-1/2 and 9-7/16 percent from 8-3/4 and 9-5/8 percent on Sunday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates fell to 8-7/8 and 9-1/2 percent compared to nine to 9-1/2 percent on Sunday.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
